    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No 25 The Casino is a one-bedroom, ground floor apartment in the fabulous, gated Casino development in the centre of Malahide Village. The unit has been recently refurbished and boasts mature views from its sunny balcony. The accommodation comprises of entrance hall, living room with access to terrace, kitchen with dining area, double bedroom and bathroom. Further features secure parking, lush communal gardens and surround sound.\r\n\r\nThe Casino is a striking development of 105 modern apartments on beautifully landscaped grounds located in Malahide, a picturesque coastal village approximately 15km from Dublin City Centre. The Casino is located on the Dublin Road alongside Malahide Railway Station, directly opposite Malahide Demesne and Cricket Club, approximately 350 metres from The Diamond, in the heart of Malahide Village. Viewing is highly recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation Details\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall:\t\r\nc. 3.7m x 1.5m\t\r\nWith laminate floor and under stair storage.\r\n\r\nLiving Room:\t \r\nc. 4.7m x 3.25m\t\r\nWith French doors to balcony and laminate floor.\r\n\r\nKitchen/ Dining Room:\t\r\nc. 4.7m x 2.4m\t\r\nFully fitted kitchen.\r\nIntegrated appliances: Fridge/ Freezer, dishwasher, hob, oven, extractor fan, microwave and washing machine/dryer combo.\r\n\r\nBedroom:\t\r\nc. 3.24m x 3m \t\r\nWith fitted wardrobes and laminate floor.\r\n\r\nBathroom:\t\r\nc. 2.7m x 1.9m\t\r\nPart tiled walls, tiled floor, bath with shower attachment and rainforest shower head, w.c., w.h.b., fitted mirror and heated towel rail."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C1 BER No.107280570 Energy Performance Indicator:167.81 kWh/m²/yr"
